cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reanalysis, please cite it as below."
title: "PvFTa1 and flowering time in twenty Kano common bean accessions"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R reanalysis of a screen-house trial of 20 Nigerian common bean
  landraces: mixed-effects variance partitioning, Duncan's test, and an ODE
  model of the floral transition. Finds the PvFTa1 amplicon spans the panel's
  entire flowering range.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Onunkwor
    given-names: Raphael Odera
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Onunkwor/pvfta1-phenology"
keywords:
  - Phaseolus vulgaris
  - flowering time
  - PvFTa1
  - mixed models
  - reproducible research
